            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Washington mountainman"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Good dip. I had to use what I had in the house, so any change to the ingredients works fine. I chose to spread the finished dish in a cassarole dish and layer with cheeses and black olives. Quite hardy."
