              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sarah Jo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used leftover seasoned taco meat in this recipe and only one can of black beans because that was all I had on hand. I did go light on the hot sauce because I was serving my husband and two kids. They made quick work of this dip and a bag of tortilla chips, I swear it was inhaled in 15 minutes.",
